Subject: Cantor Nested Inner Model Admission P0 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 8bf06f9c-3c55-4144-97e1-37c7c499bcbd
@ [canonical_uuid] b3d30f7a-6c16-4245-9d9a-3e8b79a61247

& [Need]
  + NHC-02 names the child Cantor process but NHC-04 cannot safely plan a launch while the inner model artifact instance and permission to load it are ambiguous

& [Choice]
  + bind a supplied unobserved GGUF descriptor and proposed-unloaded instance to the complete NHC-02 bundle, and validate one detached exact-tuple Ed25519 load authorization for later single-attempt consumption

& [WhyNow]
  + this is the next published dependency and advances Cantor-runs-Cantor architecture without needing a model file provider runtime process or remote host

& [Rejected]
  + ambient filenames mutable tags implicit download provider discovery boolean-only authority unsigned SOP self-authorization descriptor-as-observation and authorization-as-load
